# Creating a New Inset UI Component

## Architecture: Compound Components (Required)

Every component MUST use the compound component pattern with composition. No monolithic prop-based APIs.

## Template

```tsx
"use client";

import { ComponentPrimitive } from "@base-ui/react/component";
import { cn } from "@inset/ui/lib/utils";

// Root component - manages context/state
function ComponentRoot(props: ComponentPrimitive.Root.Props) {
  return <ComponentPrimitive.Root data-slot="component" {...props} />;
}

// Sub-component example
function ComponentPart({
  className,
  children,
  ...props
}: ComponentPrimitive.Part.Props) {
  return (
    <ComponentPrimitive.Part
      className={cn(
        // Base layout
        "flex items-center",
        // Inset styling - inner shadows, soft borders
        "rounded-lg border border-border bg-card shadow-inner",
        // Smooth animations (200ms standard)
        "transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out",
        // Focus states
        "focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring outline-none",
        // Allow className override
        className
      )}
      data-slot="component-part"
      {...props}
    >
      {children}
    </ComponentPrimitive.Part>
  );
}

// Export with clean names
export { ComponentRoot as Component, ComponentPart };
```

## Checklist

- [ ] Add `"use client"` at the top (for interactive components)
- [ ] Import Base UI primitive from `@base-ui/react/<primitive>`
- [ ] Import `cn` from `@inset/ui/lib/utils`
- [ ] Create compound components (Root + Parts)
- [ ] Add `data-slot` attribute to each component
- [ ] Use design tokens from global.css (no hardcoded colors)
- [ ] Include smooth transitions (`duration-200 ease-in-out`)
- [ ] Spread remaining props to primitives
- [ ] Allow `className` override with `cn(defaults, className)`
- [ ] Export all components for composition

## Styling Guidelines

### Use Design Tokens

```tsx
// ✅ Good - uses semantic tokens
"bg-card text-card-foreground border-border";
"text-muted-foreground bg-muted";

// ❌ Bad - hardcoded colors
"bg-zinc-900 text-white border-zinc-700";
```

### Inset Aesthetic

```tsx
// Inner shadows
"shadow-inner";
"shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]";

// Soft transitions
"transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out";

// Subtle borders with transparency
"border border-border";
```

### Animation States (Base UI)

```tsx
// For collapsible content
"data-starting-style:h-0 data-ending-style:h-0";

// For open/closed states
"[&[data-panel-open]>svg]:rotate-180";

// Disabled states
"disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-64";
```

## File Location

Place component at: `packages/ui/components/<component-name>.tsx`

## Testing

Import and use in `apps/web`:

```tsx
import { Component, ComponentPart } from "@inset/ui/component-name";

<Component>
  <ComponentPart>Content</ComponentPart>
</Component>;
```
